  "The settings of AutoMod, anti-nuke, levels, giveaways, reports, booster roles, welcome, leave and boost messages, verification, bump reminders and ping on join.": "Los ajustes de AutoMod, anti-nuke, niveles, sorteos, reportes, roles de booster, mensajes de bienvenida, salida y boost, verificación, recordatorios de bump y ping al entrar.",
