  "The usual design": "El diseño de siempre",
  "A design from Embeds (it can be Components V2). Variables: {suggestion.id}, {suggestion.number}, {suggestion.content}, {suggestion.status}, {suggestion.reason}, {suggestion.up}, {suggestion.down}, {suggestion.author} and the usual ones.": "Un diseño de Embeds (puede ser Components V2). Variables: {suggestion.id}, {suggestion.number}, {suggestion.content}, {suggestion.status}, {suggestion.reason}, {suggestion.up}, {suggestion.down}, {suggestion.author} y las de siempre.",
  "Vote in favor": "Voto a favor",
  "Vote against": "Voto en contra",
  "Color of each status": "Color de cada estado",
