  "Our staff is away right now. They answer between {start} and {end} ({timezone}). Your ticket is open and someone will reply when they are back.": "Nuestro staff no está ahora. Atiende entre {start} y {end} ({timezone}). Tu ticket está abierto y alguien responderá cuando vuelva.",
  "You can use {start}, {end} and {timezone}. Empty uses the message above.": "Puedes usar {start}, {end} y {timezone}. Vacío usa el mensaje de arriba.",
  "Create a support type": "Crea un tipo de soporte",
