  "Buy": "Comprar",
  "Not available yet": "Todavía no disponible",
  "Ceramos are for banners, name fonts, packs and badges. Buy them whenever you want: the ceramos arrive a few seconds after the payment and never expire.": "Los ceramos sirven para banners, fuentes de nombre, paquetes e insignias. Cómpralos cuando quieras: llegan unos segundos después del pago y no caducan.",
  "Thank you! Your payment was received. Your ceramos arrive in a few seconds: refresh the page to see them.": "¡Gracias! Recibimos tu pago. Tus ceramos llegan en unos segundos: actualiza la página para verlos.",
  "The payment page could not be opened. Try again in a moment.": "No se pudo abrir la página de pago. Inténtalo de nuevo en un momento.",
  "You pay in Polar. Payments are not refunded, except a charge that was duplicated, made by mistake or never delivered.": "Pagas en Polar. Los pagos no se reembolsan, salvo un cobro duplicado, hecho por error o sin entregar.",
  "Pack of ceramos bought": "Paquete de ceramos comprado",
  "For now you get them with the daily reward, with a plan or by buying a pack. A new way to earn them is on its way.": "Por ahora los consigues con la recompensa diaria, con un plan o comprando un paquete. Una nueva forma de ganarlos viene en camino.",
