  "Post the panel": "Publicar o painel",
  "Save first, then post the panel in the channel. With the prefix: !confession setup, panel, reveal, block.": "Salve primeiro e depois publique o painel no canal. Com o prefixo: !confession setup, panel, reveal, block.",
  "I still sleep with the light on.": "Eu ainda durmo com a luz acesa.",
  "Log channel": "Canal de registro",
